---
const craftPillars = [
  {
    title: "Morning Harbor Sourcing",
    tag: "100% Wild Catch",
    description: "Our fish buyers arrive at coastal boat docks at dawn. We hand-select Karimeen, Tiger Prawns, and Seer Fish directly from artisanal backwater fishermen—never frozen, preserved solely with sea ice.",
    image: "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1505253716362-afaea1d3d1af?auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80"
  },
  {
    title: "Artisanal Chekku Oil",
    tag: "Wooden Cold-Pressed",
    description: "Every curry and roast is cooked in single-origin wooden cold-pressed Chekku coconut oil. Its natural nutty fragrance and silky richness form the immutable cornerstone of authentic Malabar kitchens.",
    image: "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1512621776951-a57141f2eefd?auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80"
  },
  {
    title: "Stone-Ground Aromatics",
    tag: "Granite Pounded",
    description: "We don't use factory powdered spices. Whole Tellicherry peppercorns, roasted coriander, star anise, and fresh ginger are hand-ground daily on heavy granite stones to retain aromatic volatility.",
    image: "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1596797038530-2c107229654b?auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80"
  },
  {
    title: "Clay-Pot (Manchatti) Braising",
    tag: "Earthen Slow Cook",
    description: "Our curries simmer gently inside seasoned earthen clay pots. The porous clay breathes during slow reduction, mellowing sharp spices and letting coastal gravies reach optimal depth of flavor.",
    image: "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1565557623262-b51c2513a641?auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80"
  }
];
---

<section id="story" class="scroll-mt-20 py-20 lg:py-28 bg-[#f8faf8] dark:bg-[#060f09] border-t border-zinc-200 dark:border-[#278440]/25 relative transition-colors duration-300">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <!-- Header -->
    <div class="max-w-3xl">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2">
        <span class="h-px w-8 bg-[#278440]/60"></span>
        <span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.25em] text-[#278440] dark:text-[#38b359]">Heirloom Philosophy & Heritage</span>
      </div>
      <h2 class="mt-3 font-serif text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-zinc-900 dark:text-white sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl">
        Rooted in Tradition, <span class="green-gradient-text italic font-normal">Served with Reverence</span>
      </h2>
      <p class="mt-4 text-pretty text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-300 text-sm sm:text-base font-light leading-relaxed">
        At La Kera, dining is an act of cultural preservation. We refuse shortcuts, commercial thickening agents, and microwave reheating. Everything we serve honors the timeless techniques perfected across generations in Kerala's coastal homes.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Official Mascot Spotlight Card (Brand Guidelines Page 5) -->
    <div class="mt-12 rounded-3xl border border-zinc-200 dark:border-[#278440]/40 bg-white dark:bg-gradient-to-r dark:from-[#0c1910] dark:via-[#08150c] dark:to-[#0c1910] p-6 sm:p-10 shadow-xl dark:shadow-2xl relative overflow-hidden transition-colors duration-300">
      <div class="absolute top-0 right-0 h-64 w-64 bg-[#278440]/10 blur-3xl pointer-events-none"></div>
      <div class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 h-48 w-48 bg-[#3A6CB4]/10 blur-3xl pointer-events-none"></div>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-12 gap-8 items-center relative z-10">
        <!-- Mascot Artwork Presentation -->
        <div class="md:col-span-4 flex justify-center">
          <div class="relative group">
            <div class="absolute -inset-2 rounded-3xl bg-gradient-to-tr from-[#278440]/40 to-[#3A6CB4]/30 blur-lg opacity-80"></div>
            <div class="relative h-60 w-60 sm:h-72 sm:w-72 rounded-3xl border-2 border-[#278440] bg-[#278440] p-3 shadow-2xl overflow-hidden flex items-center justify-center">
              <img
                src="/images/lakera-logo-square.png"
                alt="La Kera Mascot - The Cheerful Kerala Server with Cloche"
                class="h-full w-full object-contain"
                loading="lazy"
              />
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Heritage Story & Hospitality Narrative -->
        <div class="md:col-span-8 flex flex-col justify-center">
          <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2">
            <span class="rounded-full border border-[#278440]/40 bg-emerald-50 dark:bg-[#278440]/15 px-3 py-1 text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-[#1e6933] dark:text-[#38b359]">
              The Real Taste of Kerala
            </span>
            <span class="rounded-full border border-amber-500/40 bg-amber-50 dark:bg-amber-950/30 px-3 py-1 text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-amber-700 dark:text-amber-400">
              Heirloom Tradition
            </span>
          </div>

          <h3 class="mt-4 font-serif text-2xl sm:text-3xl lg:text-4xl font-bold text-zinc-900 dark:text-white">
            The Cheerful Spirit of Kerala Hospitality
          </h3>

          <p class="mt-3 text-xs sm:text-sm text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-300 leading-relaxed font-light">
            Our emblem embodies the beloved tradition of coastal dining across Malabar. It portrays the quintessential Kerala server ("Chettan") in his iconic attire: a tied headcloth (<em class="text-zinc-900 dark:text-white font-medium">kettumukku</em>), a clean white vest, a shoulder towel (<em class="text-zinc-900 dark:text-white font-medium">thorthu</em>), and his classic checked lungi.
          </p>

          <p class="mt-2 text-xs sm:text-sm text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-300 leading-relaxed font-light">
            Striding briskly forward with a welcoming smile and lifting a cloche dome with aromatic steam rising, he represents our timeless promise: <strong class="text-zinc-900 dark:text-white font-medium">piping-hot food, generous hospitality, and authentic coastal recipes</strong> brought straight from our hearth to your table.
          </p>

          <!-- 3 Culinary Commitments -->
          <div class="mt-6 grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-3.5 border-t border-zinc-200 dark:border-[#278440]/20 pt-4">
            <div class="flex items-start gap-2.5">
              <span class="mt-0.5 flex h-5 w-5 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-[#278440]/15 text-[#1e6933] dark:text-[#38b359] text-xs font-bold">✓</span>
              <div>
                <p class="text-xs font-semibold text-zinc-900 dark:text-white">Piping-Hot Platter</p>
                <p class="text-[11px] text-zinc-500 dark:text-zinc-400 leading-snug mt-0.5">Freshly lifted cloche platters served straight from the fire</p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-start gap-2.5">
              <span class="mt-0.5 flex h-5 w-5 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-[#278440]/15 text-[#1e6933] dark:text-[#38b359] text-xs font-bold">✓</span>
              <div>
                <p class="text-xs font-semibold text-zinc-900 dark:text-white">Pure Coastal Flavours</p>
                <p class="text-[11px] text-zinc-500 dark:text-zinc-400 leading-snug mt-0.5">Stone-ground masalas and single-origin cold-pressed coconut oil</p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-start gap-2.5">
              <span class="mt-0.5 flex h-5 w-5 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-[#278440]/15 text-[#1e6933] dark:text-[#38b359] text-xs font-bold">✓</span>
              <div>
                <p class="text-xs font-semibold text-zinc-900 dark:text-white">Heartfelt Warmth</p>
                <p class="text-[11px] text-zinc-500 dark:text-zinc-400 leading-snug mt-0.5">Unhurried service inspired by the generous homes of Kerala</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- 4 Visual Craft Cards -->
    <div class="mt-14 grid grid-cols-1 gap-6 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4">
      {craftPillars.map((pillar) => (
        <div class="card-luxury group relative overflow-hidden rounded-3xl transition-all duration-300 flex flex-col justify-between">
          <!-- Background Image with Dark Gradient -->
          <div class="relative h-48 w-full overflow-hidden">
            <img
              src={pillar.image}
              alt={pillar.title}
              class="h-full w-full object-cover object-center transition-transform duration-700 group-hover:scale-110"
              loading="lazy"
            />
            <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/80 via-black/40 to-transparent"></div>

            <div class="absolute top-3 right-3">
              <span class="rounded-full border border-[#278440]/50 bg-black/80 backdrop-blur-md px-2.5 py-0.5 text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-[#38b359]">
                {pillar.tag}
              </span>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Body Content -->
          <div class="p-6 flex-1 flex flex-col justify-between">
            <div>
              <h3 class="font-serif text-xl font-bold text-zinc-900 dark:text-white group-hover:text-[#278440] dark:group-hover:text-[#38b359] transition-colors">
                {pillar.title}
              </h3>

              <p class="mt-3 text-xs leading-relaxed text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400 font-light">
                {pillar.description}
              </p>
            </div>

            <div class="mt-4 pt-3 border-t border-zinc-200 dark:border-[#278440]/20 flex items-center gap-1 text-[11px] font-semibold text-[#1e6933] dark:text-[#38b359]">
              <span>Generational Recipe</span>
              <span>→</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      ))}
    </div>

    <!-- Quote Banner -->
    <div class="mt-16 rounded-3xl border border-zinc-200 dark:border-[#278440]/30 bg-white dark:bg-gradient-to-r dark:from-[#0c1910] dark:via-[#08150c] dark:to-[#0c1910] p-8 sm:p-12 relative overflow-hidden text-center shadow-lg dark:shadow-xl transition-colors duration-300">
      <div class="absolute -top-12 -left-12 h-36 w-36 bg-[#278440]/10 blur-3xl pointer-events-none"></div>
      <div class="absolute -bottom-12 -right-12 h-36 w-36 bg-[#3A6CB4]/10 blur-3xl pointer-events-none"></div>

      <span class="font-serif text-4xl text-[#278440]/40 dark:text-[#38b359]/50">“</span>
      <blockquote class="font-serif text-lg sm:text-2xl italic text-zinc-800 dark:text-zinc-200 max-w-3xl mx-auto leading-relaxed -mt-4">
        Food in Kerala is not merely sustenance—it is memory, backwater mist, and ancestral hospitality served upon glistening banana leaves.
      </blockquote>
      <p class="mt-4 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.25em] text-[#1e6933] dark:text-[#38b359]">
        — Chef & Custodians of La Kera
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
